# Vercel upload exclusions (defense-in-depth for local CLI uploads).
# A Git-connected build already excludes these via .gitignore, but this makes the
# web bundle lean and guarantees huge desktop-only artifacts never reach Vercel.
release/
data/
.akansha-keys/
model-cache/
*.gguf
*.bin
*.safetensors
*.exe
*.dmg
*.msi
*.AppImage
*.7z
next-orphans/
*.log
coverage/
